  "artist": "Eckhardt Etheling",
  "description": "<p>Diagram of the cosmology represented by the Slavic four-headed scupulture Sviatovid (\"Worldseer\", \"Worldseeker\"). In some traditions, the white northward head is Svarog himself, the red westward head is Perun, the black southward head is Lada, and the green eastward head is Mokosh, thus two are male and two female. In other traditions, the eastward head is Ruevit (Rugievit), the southward head ",
  "page_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File%3ASvetovid_scheme.svg",
